      <div class="section">
        <div class="section-header">
          <div class="sh-eyebrow">Adventist Pioneer</div>
          <h2>Who Was Captain Joseph Bates?</h2>
          <p>From the quarterdeck of a sailing ship to the founding of the original, unincorporated Seventh-day Adventist platform of truth (1841&ndash;1860) &mdash; a life utterly given to God.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bio-grid">
          <div>
            <img
              src="/images/pioneers/captain-joseph-bates.jpg" loading="lazy"
