            <p class="bio-caption">Captain Joseph Bates (1792&ndash;1872) &mdash; Co-founder of the original Seventh-day Adventist platform of truth (1841&ndash;1860) &mdash; <em>not</em> the &ldquo;new organization&rdquo; state church incorporated April 15, 1904</p>

            <div class="bio-facts">
              <div class="bio-fact">
                <div class="fact-label">Born</div>
                <div class="fact-value">July 8, 1792</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bio-fact">
