        <!-- 1904 WARNING BLOCK -->
        <div style="margin-top:32px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(127,29,29,0.25),rgba(7,0,15,0.95));border:2px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.35);border-radius:20px;padding:32px 30px;">
          <div style="font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.18em;color:#ef4444;margin-bottom:14px;">&#9888; The Foundation Bates Built vs. The State Church Formed After His Death</div>
          <p style="font-family:'Crimson Text',serif;font-size:1.1rem;font-style:italic;color:rgba(248,241,221,0.92);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:16px;">
            &ldquo;We cannot now enter into any new organization, for this would mean apostasy from the truth.&rdquo;
          </p>
          <p style="font-size:0.8rem;color:rgba(252,165,165,0.8);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:22px;">&mdash; Ellen G. White, 1SM 204 (Letter 242, October 1903) &mdash; Six months before the April 15, 1904 incorporation</p>

          <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-bottom:24px;">
            <div style="background:rgba(13,5,25,0.7);border:1px solid rgba(212,165,55,0.2);border-radius:14px;padding:20px 18px;">
              <div style="font-size:0.68rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.12em;color:#fcd34d;margin-bottom:8px;">The Foundation Bates Helped Build</div>
              <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:rgba(248,241,221,0.82);line-height:1.75;">
                The <strong style="color:#fcd34d;">original Seventh-day Adventist platform of truth</strong>, established 1841&ndash;1860. Unregistered. Unincorporated. Belonging to all who keep the Commandments of God and the Faith of Jesus (Rev. 14:12). Still living today wherever the truth is held without compromise.
